              "prompt": {
                "id": "d81073bb-b3c3-5ad7-a93f-b24629361209",
                "alias": "被狼啃食",
                "prompt": "outdoors,snowy,[[nsfw]],female focus,A wild wolf sinks its sharp fangs deep into the flesh of a girl,its powerful jaws clamping down before tearing away a chunk of raw flesh. The girl's body lies lifeless on the blood-soaked ground,its hide ripped open to expose glistening red muscle and fatty tissue. Strands of flesh stretch momentarily between the wolf's teeth and the corpse before snapping apart,sending tiny droplets of blood flying. The wolf's muzzle is smeared with crimson,its eyes locked in a primal focus as it rips another mouthful from the exposed ribcage. Nearby,the torn organs spill slightly from the abdominal cavity,steam rising faintly in the cold air.,char1：girl,severed head,amputation plane,severed arms with visible tendons and marbled muscle tissue lay beside thick meaty legs,The torso is bisected cleanly,revealing the ribcage and layers of flesh with streaks of yellow fat running through it. {{disembodied torso,dissected}},{{insection}},{{mutilation,gore,guro,dismemberment}},smashed body,mangled body,intestines pulled out from waist,yellow fat tissues with internal organs,vertebrae,bags under eyes,gloomy,empty eyes,upturned eyes,rolling eyes,uneven eyes,one eye half-closed,frown,:o,facing away,{tongue out},char2：wolf,animal,stepping on another,gleaming eyes,drooling,biting another,",
                "description": "",
